Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Web Content Display|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: I Frame Demo
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|testray.component.names|IFrame Portlet|
	When Page add
		|columnName|1 Column|
		|pageName|IFrame Page|
		|sitePageType|Empty Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|IFrame Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|IFrame|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And IFrame add CP
		|sourceURL|http://iscaliforniaonfire.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|IFrame Page|
	And SelectFrame at locator 'IFrame#IFRAME_PORTLET'
	Then AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'updated' at locator 'Embedded#EMBEDDED_TEXT_UPDATED'

Scenario: Sales Demo
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|testray.component.names|Web Content Administration,Web Content Display|
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentContent|DHS Content|
		|webContentTitle|DHS Title|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator open URL
	And SitePageNavigator goto Edit Page
		|page|Welcome|
	And Page edit Page Layout Column
		|columnName|2 Columns (50/50)|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Welcome|
	And Content add PG
		|assetTitle|DHS Title|
		|webContentContent|DHS Content|
	And WebContent view PG Via WCD
		|webContentContent|DHS Content|
		|webContentTitle|DHS Title|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And WebContent view No Edit WC Via WCD
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
		|webContentContent|DHS Content|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Sales Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Sales Page|
	And MobileDevice preview PG
		|deviceType|tablet|
	And Navigator open URL
	Then MobileDevice preview PG
		|deviceType|smartphone|